{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/ai/dev-page","title":"Live page MCP","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"live-page-mcp","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Live page MCP"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The running development tab publishes its named controls. A coding agent fills,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"clicks, and inspects "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"that"}]},{"t":"text","text":" page — no second browser, no DOM reverse-engineering."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" a Cursor agent must drive or inspect the "},{"t":"code","text":"ng serve"},{"t":"text","text":" tab you"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"already have open."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Not when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" you are writing Craft away from a running app — use"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/resources/ai-agents","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/mcp"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for docs and skills. "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Not when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" you"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"want to mutate a primitive without the UI — use the "},{"t":"code","text":"registry.*"},{"t":"text","text":" tools on the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"same local MCP."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"connect-the-local-mcp","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Connect the local MCP"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The tool lives on "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/function-registry-mcp"},{"t":"text","text":", not on the published"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/mcp"},{"t":"text","text":" docs server. From the craft-ts repo:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"npm","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"run","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"registry:mcp","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"sh","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Point Cursor at that stdio server. It already listens on "},{"t":"code","text":"ws://127.0.0.1:3333"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for the demo tab. Each tab keeps a stable "},{"t":"code","text":"clientId"},{"t":"text","text":" in "},{"t":"code","text":"sessionStorage"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"one-ready-tab","children":[{"t":"text","text":"One ready tab"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Each tab has a "},{"t":"code","text":"clientId"},{"t":"text","text":" in "},{"t":"code","text":"sessionStorage"},{"t":"text","text":". Duplicating a tab copies it; the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"broker assigns a new id ("},{"t":"code","text":"hello/ok"},{"t":"text","text":") so the two tabs do not fight."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Omit "},{"t":"code","text":"clientId"},{"t":"text","text":" when "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"exactly one tab is "},{"t":"code","text":"ready"}]},{"t":"text","text":". A ghost "},{"t":"code","text":"reloading"},{"t":"text","text":" card"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"(HMR, F5) does not count. Two "},{"t":"code","text":"ready"},{"t":"text","text":" tabs → pass "},{"t":"code","text":"clientId"},{"t":"text","text":" from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"registry.clients"},{"t":"text","text":" (id, status, url). Never pick “latest”. The error is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"Multiple ready page clients; clientId is required. Available clients: <id> ready <url>, <id> ready <url>"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Zero ready with several ghosts is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"No ready page client. Reloading: <id> (last url <url>), <id> (last url <url>)"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Zero cards is "},{"t":"code","text":"page client is not connected"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Closing the tab sends "},{"t":"code","text":"page/goodbye"},{"t":"text","text":"; the card is dropped. Opening a new tab is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a new id. If "},{"t":"code","text":"page client \"<id>\" is not connected"},{"t":"text","text":", call "},{"t":"code","text":"registry.clients"},{"t":"text","text":" and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"retry without id when a single ready remains."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Closing without goodbye (crash) looks like reload for up to 20s."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"one-tool-page","children":[{"t":"text","text":"One tool: "},{"t":"code","text":"page"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Omit "},{"t":"code","text":"act"},{"t":"text","text":" to read the current surface. The broker "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"always asks the live tab"}]},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"— a Craft "},{"t":"code","text":"value:"},{"t":"text","text":" that changed without a DOM mutation is still current. Pass"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"act"},{"t":"text","text":" to run a batch, then receive the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"new"}]},{"t":"text","text":" state in the same round-trip."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Default "},{"t":"code","text":"detail"},{"t":"text","text":" is "},{"t":"code","text":"\"controls\""},{"t":"text","text":": the named interactive surface (id, role,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"accessible name, value, enabled, index, and "},{"t":"code","text":"track"},{"t":"text","text":" when the node is inside"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":"). Pass "},{"t":"code","text":"detail: \"dom-styles\""},{"t":"text","text":" only to debug layout or CSS — it is large"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and opt-in."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"id"},{"t":"text","text":" is the literal local name from the helper:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { button, craftComponent } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"SaveToolbar"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'SaveToolbar'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  {},","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'save'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { type: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'button'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Save'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"That name is unique in the app graph"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"assertInteractiveElementNamed"},{"t":"text","text":"). The renderer writes "},{"t":"code","text":"data-craft-name=\"save\""},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Do not prefix it with the component name. When "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" repeats the same id, pass"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"match.index"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"match.track"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"fill-click-goto-ready","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fill, click, goto, ready"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"act: [{ \"goto\": \"/login-form\" }]"},{"t":"text","text":" navigates in the tab (Craft router)."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The WebSocket stays up. Prefer "},{"t":"code","text":"goto"},{"t":"text","text":" over clicking "},{"t":"code","text":"navLink"},{"t":"text","text":" — every nav item"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"shares that id. Paths like "},{"t":"code","text":"/login-form"},{"t":"text","text":" and full URLs both work."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A "},{"t":"code","text":"fill"},{"t":"text","text":" sets the control and dispatches one "},{"t":"code","text":"input"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"change"},{"t":"text","text":" (then blur), so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftFieldDirective"},{"t":"text","text":" validation and touched state run. A click is "},{"t":"code","text":"act"},{"t":"text","text":" with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"only "},{"t":"code","text":"id"},{"t":"text","text":". The batch runs in order and stops on the first error."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"While "},{"t":"code","text":"ng serve"},{"t":"text","text":" rebuilds, the socket drops but the broker "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"keeps"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the client"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"card. "},{"t":"code","text":"page"},{"t":"text","text":" waits until the tab is "},{"t":"code","text":"ready"},{"t":"text","text":" again (up to "},{"t":"code","text":"timeoutMs"},{"t":"text","text":", default"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"20s). You do not poll."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/resources/ai-agents","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Coding agents"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — which MCP to use for docs vs the live tab"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — unique interactive names"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/advanced/observability","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Observability"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — primitive traces, not DOM"}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"connect-the-local-mcp","text":"Connect the local MCP"},{"level":2,"id":"one-ready-tab","text":"One ready tab"},{"level":2,"id":"one-tool-page","text":"One tool: page"},{"level":2,"id":"fill-click-goto-ready","text":"Fill, click, goto, ready"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See also"}]}